# Context

## Why this way
No image generator is available in this session, so people are drawn
in code (ChibiPainter) until illustrated sprites exist. Skin and hair
come from a hash of the name, so no new data is authored.

## Gotchas
- CityMap.load_tower_state now calls _silence_city, not the live
  handler, so a reload never replays the bloom or the camera kick.
- CameraShake.kick_in finds the shake through the viewport camera.
  Scenes without it ignore kicks.
